  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Oh the Dreadful Wind and Rain**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Raliegh & Spencer (tansitions to mono during this song)**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Walkin Shoes**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Hughway Hypnosis**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Handsome Molly**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **It's Raining Here This Morning**: back after 191 archived shows (1280 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **Peartree**: rare: 5 archived performances [2]\n- **Steam Powered Areoplane**: back after 87 archived shows (409 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2023-07-29.aud.merrytime** (recommended): audience recording; 29 songs; 158 min [1]. Said about its sound: Right microphone was lost about 42 minutes into set one; left channel was copied and inverted to the right for the rest of the show; The first 40 minutes of set one sound pretty good; the remainder of the recording sounds just okay [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2023-07-29.aud.merrytime**: taped by unknown grasshead; transferred by amerrytimearchivist; source: Schoeps MK4/CMC6 [1]. Also: Recorded with Schoeps MK4/CMC6 microphones into a MixPre 6 at 24-bit/48kHz, mics placed at the board's right front corner, about 10 feet high [1]",
